# 一台 station 的记忆 over 记忆 on the tape (MBUI_FIXTURE=settings-memories MBUI_WIN=700x760): Studio's memory opened,
# then swiped back by a finger from its panel's edge (an iPad's: a mouse swipes no page back), 300 across, let go.
timeout 20000
until 全局记忆 · 项目记忆
wait 1200
tap Studio
wait 1800
drag 70 400 300 0 600
wait 1500
exit
